<title>GERMANY: Puma 9-month operating profit up 3.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Puma 9-month operating profit up 3.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			    58.6   vs 56.5</p>
<p>Profit before taxes and extraordinary</p>
<p>	 income				     60.1   vs 47.5</p>
<p>    Net sales				     399.6  vs 350.1</p>
<p>    Orders in hand (at end Sept)	    205.9  vs 155.9</p>
<p>    Workforce				     807    vs 739</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sports equipment group is Puma AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
